        <mxCell id="sm_note" value="&lt;b&gt;AUDIT LEDGER ARCHITECTURE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Stock is NEVER stored on the products table. Inventory lives strictly in product_variants. Every restock, order checkout deduction, or cancellation return inserts a row into stock_adjustments for complete traceability." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF9C3;strokeColor=#CA8A04;fontColor=#854D0E;fontSize=11;align=left;spacing=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1">
